    "ampullary/9/standard/0": {
      "source": "After endoscopic papillectomy or surgical ampullectomy, perform duodenoscopy with biopsies of the scar and of any abnormal area within the first 3 months, at 6 and 12 months, and yearly thereafter for at least 5 years.",
      "concise": "After papillectomy/ampullectomy: duodenoscopy with scar/abnormal-area biopsies within 3 months, at 6 and 12 months, then yearly for ≥5 years."
